          {
            "title": "Return a clear signal",
            "id": 152119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zwracaj wyraźny sygnał, gdy tekst dotyczący ilości nie może zostać przekonwertowany.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Obsługuj tylko nieprawidłowy tekst liczby całkowitej i zwracaj sygnał niepowodzenia bez wymyślania ilości.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>ValueError</code>, a następnie <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check for None",
            "id": 152120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sprawdź wynik parsera przed przetworzeniem zamówienia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>is None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przekaż nieprawidłowy tekst liczby całkowitej i sprawdź sygnał niepowodzenia, aby kod wywołujący wyświetlił <code>Skip order</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"many\"</code>, a następnie <code>is None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the sentinel",
            "id": 152121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nieprawidłowa ilość oznacza, że nie można kontynuować zamówienia. Która wartość zwracana jasno wskazuje na tę porażkę bez wymyślania ilości?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return None</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return 0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return 1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use zero deliberately",
            "id": 152122,
